ted_at":"2026-11-03T05:47:15Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/download/v0.1.14/prism-inference-0.1.14-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/tarball/v0.1.14","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/zipball/v0.1.14","body":"Fixes context-overflow handling in the authenticated private Swift service. Genuine prompt token-capacity overflow keeps its typed classification and returns HTTP 413 with `context_length_exceeded` before generation. Unknown failures remain fail-closed. Rejected counts invalidate stale prepared requests and permit a healthy owner to count and generate again without automatic replay.\n\nIncludes the existing Windows ARM64 and x64 CPU executables and matching integrity receipts, built from exact source `9e8ea3e2c042ab0c3f1a8e9596ff155e202c3c57` with the pinned nightly-2026-10-22 compilers. Dependencies, notices, CPU arithmetic, model/adapter identities, memory reserves and defaults are unchanged.\n\nPTQ1 and adapters remain explicit selections. This release does not qualify an application default, full-model numerical parity, provenance, performance, quality or owner comfort.\n\nOwning exact-source checks:\n- [Foundation](https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/actions/runs/41580496421)\n- [Runtime conformance](https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/actions/runs/41580660471)\n- [Source package](https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/actions/runs/41580658543)\n\nThe attached archives and receipts are unchanged from the owning Foundation run. Registry publication remains separate."},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/432047824","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/432047824/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/432047824/assets{?name,la