","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":3469681,"digest":"sha256:1f09621e1114434a21fd4d45bde0784e631e06944dbdb926d0fe0a23fc15735b","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-31T07:17:03Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T07:17:04Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/download/v0.1.10/prism-inference-0.1.10-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/tarball/v0.1.10","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/zipball/v0.1.10","body":"Prepare native Windows model verification and explicit same-session prefix reuse for Swift.\n\n- GGUF artifact verification uses audited Windows CNG SHA-256 through bounded streams while preserving complete byte verification, retained handles, cursor restoration and failure behavior. Other targets retain portable Rust hashing.\n- The private native service accepts explicit `--prompt-reuse latest` selection. Exact latest committed prefixes require bit-identical adapter scale; edited histories recompute and transactional failures preserve state and sampling. The default remains fresh state for each request, with one row worker.\n- Focused controls compare full sampled logits and logical attention/recurrent/convolution state with fresh computation, including scale changes, rollback, sealed KV pages and stop draws.\n\nExact source: `749a5f5b43bf77764a29682557ec91a8de8dcdef`.\n\nOwning validation: [Foundation](https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/actions/runs/41178893822) and [runtime conformance](https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/actions/runs/41178893812). Both completed successfully on this exact main source. Bundle receipts bind the exact source, pinned native compiler, target and every archive entry.\n\nThis is an experimental GitHub binary prerelease. It does not qualify actual-model reuse, startup performance, full-context/long-output behavior, adapter authoring basis, quality or default-runtime promotion. Registry delivery remains separate: native-hash publication, a new GGUF registry version and an updated exact runtime dependency are required. Server registry publication remains disabled pending its reviewed Windows credential helper release. Previous releases remain available for rollback.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/429279123","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/429279123/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/429279123/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/tag/v0.1.9","id":429279123,"author":{"login":"symbiogenesis","id":1724472,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ0NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724472?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis","html_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOVWipD84ZlkeT","tag_name":"v0.1.9","target_commitish":"7aca2251f09acb345d4afb53d5ce411f81017745","