enesis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":3464239,"digest":"sha256:f553493e43ac9c5af26ae8462f1f5d2c9ab1db7db7ec737602fe7d2ee2a6a28f","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-10-30T16:56:20Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T16:56:21Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/download/v0.1.9/prism-inference-0.1.9-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/tarball/v0.1.9","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/zipball/v0.1.9","body":"Prism Inference 0.1.9 makes the optional persistent row-worker implementation available in the checked Windows ARM64 and x64 binaries. Every entry point still defaults to **one** row worker. Multiple workers require explicit selection; this prerelease does not enable four workers in Runner or change any app default.\n\nThe source also extends the qualification example's explicit worker/backend controls. Full-model correctness, performance, creative quality and daily-service qualification remain unqualified. Synthetic and conformance checks do not establish a speed gain.\n\nBoth complete source gates passed at `7aca2251f09acb345d4afb53d5ce411f81017745`:\n\n- [Full Foundation](https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/actions/runs/41029550347)\n- [Full runtime conformance](https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/actions/runs/41028418717)\n\nThese are the exact source-bound bundles from the full Foundation run, with unchanged receipt format and a flat nine-file inventory. The release build explicitly enables `prism-inference/parallel-rows,prism-inference-server/parallel-rows`; no later stage recompiles the packaged binaries. Runtime source and all asset/payload digests were verified locally without executing the staged binaries or loading a model.\n\nThe Windows server retains the exact external credential helper at SwiftBonsai2Runner revision `abe04b4a8eff18388af96f0e75c8a8d180b81989`. That Git dependency is not included in the Prism source ZIP and its source must be retained separately. Server crates.io publication remains disabled.\n\n- [Exact Prism source](https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/archive/7aca2251f09acb345d4afb53d5ce411f81017745.zip)\n- [Exact external helper source](https://github.com/symbiogenesis/SwiftBonsai2Runner/archive/abe04b4a8eff18388af96f0e75c8a8d180b81989.zip)\n\nThis prerelease provides reviewed artifact provenance and explicit qualification controls. No production Runner lock, installed runtime, model, worker count, sandbox policy or resource limit was changed by staging it. Do not treat it as default-runtime promotion or PTQ1 release-quality approval.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/428739883","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/428739883/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/428739883/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/tag/v0.1.8","id":428739883,"author":{"login":"symbiogenesis","id":1724472,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ0NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724472?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis","html_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscri