ser","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1974,"digest":"sha256:fd1f8208d1b4b3c3422a3c52e46648f5e1dbb51c353cb593ced8d4c964396491","download_count":3,"created_at":"2026-10-30T06:15:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:15:40Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/download/v0.1.7/prism-inference-0.1.7-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.receipt.json"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/assets/691149594","id":691149594,"node_id":"RA_kwDOVWipD84pMhsa","name":"prism-inference-0.1.7-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip","label":"","uploader":{"login":"symbiogenesis","id":1724472,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ0NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724472?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis","html_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":3275110,"digest":"sha256:9e9e0c49f5bfff3374a2f0007c8aadf1c03aaf174875a44e81b3a12a79072c1f","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-10-30T06:15:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:15:41Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/download/v0.1.7/prism-inference-0.1.7-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/tarball/v0.1.7","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/zipball/v0.1.7","body":"Prism Inference 0.1.7 adds explicit current-weight Swift PTQ1 and approved rank-one adapter service profiles. It also binds prepared chat requests to session and adapter settings, and resets graph state safely when adapter scale changes.\n\nThe original PQ2/no-adapter interfaces remain available. The private server accepts the canonical single-slot LoRA request emitted by Runner and validates exact readiness identities and scale values. Model defaults and admission limits are unchanged.\n\nSource: 27e4860ea71b998b896191524ed980a586f022c6.\nFoundation: https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/actions/runs/41009394716 (passed).\nRuntime conformance: https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/actions/runs/41009394718 (passed).\n\nThe ARM64 and x64 bundles and receipts are from that exact Foundation run. The ARM64 bundle has also passed Runner's offline source/archive/file-identity review.\n\nThis prerelease does not establish PTQ1 release quality, full-context resources, sustained performance, creative quality or daily-service isolation. A five-minute owner-device numerical smoke and application smoke remain separate qualification evidence. PTQ1 is not promoted to the default model or runtime.\r\n\nThe source-pinned one-token native/Rust Auto numerical smoke at adapter scale 1.3 passed all 129 files / 39,504,384 logits and live-state values byte for byte in owner CI: https://github.com/symbiogenesis/SwiftBonsai2Runner/actions/runs/41012887460 . The earliest recorded setup through job completion took 196 seconds. This is correctness evidence for the fixed supplied token, not throughput or service qualification.\n\nApplication boundary: required-container owner CI https://github.com/symbiogenesis/SwiftBonsai2Runner/actions/runs/41014805669 failed during backend startup before verified readiness or streaming. The captured result does not establish whether weights loaded. This prerelease remains unqualified for that application profile; the numerical smoke above is separate.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/426167140","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/426167140/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/426167140/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/tag/v0.1.6","id":426167140,"author":{"login":"symbiogenesis","id":1724472,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ0NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724472?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis","html_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOVWipD84ZZstk","tag_name":"v0.1.6","target_commitish":"main","name":"Prism Inference 0.1.6","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-28T01:28:26Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T01:28:37Z","published_at":"2026-10-28T01:28:37Z","assets":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-