users/symbiogenesis","html_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":3175061,"digest":"sha256:040bd29a7300b0dcbb1e96b07f9d4ea2d3d47b0dd383a8b420c0b11bcf5a0c2d","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-10-26T21:39:57Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T21:39:59Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/download/v0.1.4/prism-inference-0.1.4-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/tarball/v0.1.4","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/zipball/v0.1.4","body":"Sampled generation now reuses candidate storage across tokens, avoiding repeated allocation/free of the 2,979,840-byte Swift candidate payload. Transaction clones copy sampler/RNG state without copying scratch.\n\nAttention reads adjacent FP16 value channels in bounded 32-channel tiles. A 256-channel head traverses the paged value cache eight times instead of 256, preserving Source summation and the pinned FMA, padding and reduction order. Accumulator payload is bounded at 2 KiB, with no expanded cache.\n\nValidation: [Foundation 40405141588](https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/actions/runs/40405141588) passed at `72a55f66cf395294d95b4e3393932ff2302047dc`. Focused regressions include frozen seeded draws, sampled-request rollback, full-graph state/logit recovery and bitwise attention comparisons through 8,191 cached tokens. Bundle/file hashes, executable targets and source identities were reviewed independently.\n\nThese are allocation and traversal changes, not measured peak-RAM or tokens/sec claims. Existing full-model, creative-quality, daily-service and target-device performance qualification boundaries remain in place. Full upstream conformance remains separately tracked.\n"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/423917241","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/423917241/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/423917241/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/tag/v0.1.3","id":423917241,"author":{"login":"symbiogenesis","id":1724472,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MjQ0NzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1724472?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis","html_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/symbiogenesis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},